{%- comment -%}
  Homepage, rebuilt 2026-09-13 from Jeff's "Homepage edits/updates" brief (20 numbered points) and
  his Base-Note-Homepage-2 mock. Wilson cleared the two contentious points: #8 (catalogue 32 -> 8)
  and #4 (3D vial off the homepage, ARCHIVED not deleted).

  Deliberate departures from his mock, and why:
   - Design tokens stay the LIVE ones (--scent-green #22392b / --scent-cream #f4efe3), not the
     mock's #1c3a2e / #f6f1e8. His own #17/#18 ask for one consistent store; matching his hex
     would make the homepage disagree with the collection and PDP.
   - Cards render through studio-fragrance-card, not his `${p.img}` JS template, so the $18
     add-on quote, the selling-plan guard and add-to-cart keep working.
   - Rotation prices come from the real selling plan, not the mock's hardcoded $15/$20.
   - #13: his brief says the lyric blocks repeat "six times"; only ONE existed. The campaign
     section is removed because his mock omits it, not because it was duplicated.

  ARCHIVED, NOT DELETED (#4): snippets/vial-studio.liquid and assets/basenote-vial-studio.*
  all remain in the theme. Only the render call is gone. To bring it back on About or FAQ:
      {% render 'vial-studio', products: collection.products, section_id: section.id %}
  Jeff 2026-09-13: "great for a plug and play but could impact loading consistency."
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign scent_collection = section.settings.collection | default: collections.fragrances
  assign featured_count = section.settings.featured_count | default: 8
  assign first_product = scent_collection.products | first
  assign first_variant = first_product.variants | first
  assign first_plan = first_variant.selling_plan_allocations | first
  assign renewal_price = first_plan.price_adjustments.last.price | default: first_variant.price
  assign collection_url = scent_collection.url | default: '/collections/fragrances'
-%}
{{ 'scent-storefront.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'fragrance-reference.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="scent-home bn-home">
  {%- comment -%} #1 one hero CTA · #2 offer on one line · #3 "no subscription" stays in the hero
    · #6 the vial is a side strip, not a full-width card {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="bn-hero" aria-labelledby="ScentHomeTitle">
    <div class="bn-hero__copy">
      <p class="scent-eyebrow">Exceptional fragrance. Your way.</p>
      <h1 id="ScentHomeTitle">A little vial.<br>A whole new <em>feeling.</em></h1>
      <p class="bn-hero__lede">Authentic designer and niche, decanted to a 5ml spray. Try it on your skin before you buy the bottle. One-time purchase &mdash; no subscription required.</p>
      <a class="scent-button bn-hero__cta" href="{{ collection_url }}">Find your first vial</a>
      <p class="bn-hero__offer">{{ first_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} first vial <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> $18 each extra in the same order.<br>Free US shipping over $50.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bn-hero__photo">
      <img
        src="{{ 'homepage-vial-photo.jpg' | asset_url }}"
        alt="A filled Base Note 5ml glass spray atomizer labelled Your Choice"
        width="480" height="640" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} #7 three short steps, replacing the repeated slogan {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="bn-steps" aria-labelledby="BnStepsTitle">
    <h2 id="BnStepsTitle">How a 5ml vial works</h2>
    <div class="bn-steps__row">
      <p class="bn-step"><b>01 Pick</b>Any scent in the collection. Creed, Bond, Dior, Xerjoff.</p>
      <p class="bn-step"><b>02 We fill it</b>Authentic fragrance, from the original bottle.</p>
      <p class="bn-step"><b>03 Wear it</b>About 60 sprays. Full bottle later, on the scent page.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} #8 eight best sellers, not the full catalogue · #9 same card as the collection
    · #19 no gender/season filters here - those live on /collections/fragrances.
    The collection is sorted "Best selling" in Admin, so limit follows real sales order. {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="bn-featured" id="fragrances" aria-labelledby="BnFeaturedTitle">
    <div class="bn-featured__head">
      <h2 id="BnFeaturedTitle">Start with these</h2>
      <a href="{{ collection_url }}">See all {{ scent_collection.products_count }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
    <scent-catalog class="fragrance-catalog fragrance-catalog--home" data-source="Homepage featured">
      <div class="fragrance-catalog__body bn-featured__body">
        <p class="visually-hidden" data-scent-count aria-live="polite">{{ scent_collection.products_count }} scents</p>
        <div class="scent-grid bn-featured__grid">
          {%- for product in scent_collection.products limit: featured_count -%}
            {% render 'studio-fragrance-card', product: product, section_id: section.id, compact: true %}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <p class="scent-feedback" data-scent-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
    </scent-catalog>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} #10 one-time first, rotation optional · #12 the whole Rotation card opens the popup
    · #16 "Notify us", house voice {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="bn-ways" id="ways-to-shop" aria-labelledby="BnWaysTitle">
    <h2 id="BnWaysTitle">Three ways</h2>
    <div class="bn-ways__grid">
      <article class="bn-way">
        <span class="bn-way__num">01 &mdash; Start here</span>
        <h3>One-time vial</h3>
        <p>{{ first_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} first. $18 each extra in the same cart. No recurring charge.</p>
        <a href="{{ collection_url }}">Shop 5ml vials</a>
      </article>

      <article class="bn-way bn-way--action" id="openRotation" role="button" tabindex="0"
               aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="rotationModal">
        <span class="bn-way__num">02 &mdash; Optional</span>
        <h3>Monthly Rotation</h3>
        <p>{% if first_plan %}{{ first_plan.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }} first shipment, then {{ renewal_price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}/month.{% endif %} Swap, pause, or cancel.</p>
        <span class="bn-way__link">See how Rotation works</span>
      </article>

      <article class="bn-way" id="box-sets">
        <span class="bn-way__num">03 &mdash; Soon</span>
        <h3>Box sets</h3>
        <p>A few vials in one box. For gifting and comparing side by side.</p>
        <a href="/pages/full-bottles#BottleEnquiry">Notify us</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} #11 Rotation explained in a popup rather than a separate page {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="bn-modal-bg" id="rotationModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="rotTitle" hidden>
    <div class="bn-modal">
      <button class="bn-modal__close" type="button" data-rotation-close aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <h3 id="rotTitle">Monthly Rotation</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Choose any fragrance from our full catalog. Plan up to 5 months ahead, or leave a month blank and we&rsquo;ll send that month&rsquo;s fragrance of the month.</li>
        <li>A new 5ml atomizer ships automatically every month &mdash; about 60 sprays, a month&rsquo;s supply.</li>
        <li>Swap, skip, or cancel anything from your account. No phone calls, no fees.</li>
      </ol>
      <a class="scent-button" href="/pages/monthly-rotation">Start Monthly Rotation</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} #14 FAQ kept, copy tightened · #15 full-bottle answer points at the same
    waitlist wording the PDP uses {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="bn-faq" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="BnFaqTitle">
    <h2 id="BnFaqTitle">Your first vial, explained</h2>
    <details open>
      <summary>What is a decant?</summary>
      <p>Authentic fragrance transferred from the original bottle into a smaller spray. Yours is 5ml and labeled with the scent you chose.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Do I have to subscribe?</summary>
      <p>No. One-time vials are the default. Monthly Rotation is separate and optional.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How does $18 after work?</summary>
      <p>First 5ml in the cart is {{ first_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}. Every extra vial in that same order is $18.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I buy the full bottle?</summary>
      <p>When we have it, the 50ml or 100ml is on that scent&rsquo;s page. If it isn&rsquo;t listed, use Notify us.</p>
    </details>
  </section>
</div>

<script src="{{ 'scent-storefront.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script>
  (function () {
    'use strict';
    // #12: the whole Rotation card opens the popup. Jeff's note was that the text link was easy
    // to miss, and that an earlier attempt ran before the modal existed - so this binds on the
    // card, and bails safely if either node is absent rather than throwing.
    var opener = document.getElementById('openRotation');
    var modal = document.getElementById('rotationModal');
    if (!opener || !modal) return;
    var lastFocus = null;
    function open() {
      lastFocus = document.activeElement;
      modal.hidden = false;
      var close = modal.querySelector('[data-rotation-close]');
      if (close) close.focus();
    }
    function close() {
      modal.hidden = true;
      if (lastFocus && lastFocus.isConnected) lastFocus.focus();
    }
    opener.addEventListener('click', open);
    opener.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
      if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') { e.preventDefault(); open(); }
    });
    modal.addEventListener('click', function (e) { if (e.target === modal) close(); });
    var closeBtn = modal.querySelector('[data-rotation-close]');
    if (closeBtn) closeBtn.addEventListener('click', close);
    document.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
      if (e.key === 'Escape' && !modal.hidden) close();
    });
  })();
</script>

{% stylesheet %}
  .bn-home { --bn-max: 71rem; }
  .bn-home h1, .bn-home h2, .bn-home h3 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; }

  .bn-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(0, .65fr); gap: 2.5rem; align-items: center; width: min(100% - 3rem, var(--bn-max)); margin-inline: auto; padding-block: 3rem 1.75rem; }
  .bn-hero__copy { min-width: 0; }
  .bn-home .bn-hero h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.04; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  .bn-hero__lede { max-width: 34em; margin: 1rem 0 1.4rem; color: var(--scent-muted); font: .98rem/1.65 'Jost', sans-serif; }
  .bn-hero__cta { min-height: 3.25rem; }
  .bn-hero__offer { margin: .9rem 0 0; color: var(--scent-muted); font: .84rem/1.6 'Jost', sans-serif; }
  .bn-hero__offer span { margin-inline: .35rem; color: var(--scent-gold); }
  .bn-hero__photo { min-width: 0; }
  .bn-hero__photo img { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 17rem; height: auto; margin-inline: auto; mix-blend-mode: multiply; }

  .bn-steps { width: min(100% - 3rem, var(--bn-max)); margin-inline: auto; padding-block: 1.5rem 2.5rem; border-block-start: 1px solid var(--scent-line); }
  .bn-steps h2 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .bn-steps__row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .bn-step { margin: 0; color: var(--scent-muted); font: .88rem/1.6 'Jost', sans-serif; }
  .bn-step b { display: block; margin-block-end: .3rem; color: var(--scent-ink); font-weight: 600; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }

  .bn-featured { width: min(100% - 3rem, var(--bn-max)); margin-inline: auto; padding-block: 1rem 3rem; }
  .bn-featured__head { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 1.2rem; }
  .bn-featured__head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .bn-featured__head a { color: var(--scent-green); font: .82rem/1.4 'Jost', sans-serif; border-block-end: 1px solid var(--scent-gold); padding-block-end: .15rem; }
  .bn-home .bn-featured__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); }

  .bn-ways { width: min(100% - 3rem, var(--bn-max)); margin-inline: auto; padding-block: 1rem 3rem; border-block-start: 1px solid var(--scent-line); }
  .bn-ways h2 { margin: 1.5rem 0 1.2rem; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .bn-ways__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .9rem; }
  .bn-way { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.3rem; border: 1px solid var(--scent-line); border-radius: .3rem; background: rgb(255 255 255 / 45%); }
  .bn-way__num { color: var(--scent-muted); font: .67rem/1.4 'Jost', sans-serif; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .bn-way h3 { margin: .5rem 0 .45rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .bn-way p { margin: 0 0 .9rem; color: var(--scent-muted); font: .86rem/1.6 'Jost', sans-serif; }
  .bn-way a, .bn-way__link { margin-block-start: auto; color: var(--scent-green); font: .82rem/1.4 'Jost', sans-serif; border-block-end: 1px solid var(--scent-gold); padding-block-end: .15rem; align-self: flex-start; }
  .bn-way--action { cursor: pointer; }
  .bn-way--action:hover { background: rgb(255 255 255 / 75%); }
  .bn-way--action:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--scent-green); outline-offset: 3px; }

  .bn-modal-bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 90; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 1.25rem; background: rgb(34 57 43 / 45%); }
  .bn-modal-bg[hidden] { display: none; }
  .bn-modal { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 30rem; padding: 1.75rem 1.6rem 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--scent-line); border-radius: .4rem; background: var(--scent-cream); }
  .bn-modal h3 { margin: 0 0 .9rem; font-size: 1.9rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .bn-modal ol { margin: 0 0 1.2rem; padding-inline-start: 1.2rem; }
  .bn-modal li { margin-block-end: .7rem; color: var(--scent-muted); font: .88rem/1.6 'Jost', sans-serif; }
  .bn-modal__close { position: absolute; top: .5rem; right: .6rem; width: 2.75rem; height: 2.75rem; border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--scent-muted); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1; cursor: pointer; }

  .bn-faq { width: min(100% - 3rem, 45rem); margin-inline: auto; padding-block: 1rem 4rem; border-block-start: 1px solid var(--scent-line); }
  .bn-faq h2 { margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .bn-faq details { border-block-end: 1px solid var(--scent-line); }
  .bn-faq summary { min-height: 2.75rem; display: flex; align-items: center; padding-block: .7rem; cursor: pointer; font: .95rem/1.5 'Jost', sans-serif; }
  .bn-faq p { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--scent-muted); font: .88rem/1.7 'Jost', sans-serif; }

  @media (max-width: 60rem) {
    .bn-home .bn-featured__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .bn-ways__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 46rem) {
    .bn-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1.25rem; padding-block: 1.75rem 1.25rem; }
    .bn-hero__photo { order: -1; }
    .bn-hero__photo img { max-width: 10.5rem; }
    .bn-steps__row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .8rem; }
    .bn-featured__head { align-items: start; flex-direction: column; gap: .4rem; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Scent studio homepage",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Fragrance collection" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "featured_count", "min": 4, "max": 12, "step": 2, "default": 8, "label": "Featured products on the homepage" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "campaign_image", "label": "Campaign image (unused since 2026-09-13)" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Scent studio homepage" }]
}
{% endschema %}
